  <diagram id="reuse-plan-flowthrough-f05-lookahead-prefetch" name="Prefetch actions name a future record" ecgTitle="Prefetch actions name a future record" ecgDescription="The running record&#x27;s sixteen-word window contains only property lines A and B. B is current and A first appears at lead one, so neither Full14 nor Scale6 issues a prefetch for this record. A second flow contrasts Full14&#x27;s offline encoded lead with Scale6&#x27;s runtime selection from record bytes. Both decode the target vertex from the selected future record and apply resident, pending and admission filters.">
